sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant P as Primary
    participant N2 as Node2
    participant N3 as Node3
    participant N4 as Node4
    C->>P: submit transaction
    P->>P: build block, merkle root, state root
    P->>N2: PRE_PREPARE(block)
    P->>N3: PRE_PREPARE(block)
    P->>N4: PRE_PREPARE(block)
    N2->>P: PREPARE
    N3->>P: PREPARE
    N4->>P: PREPARE
    P->>N2: COMMIT
    P->>N3: COMMIT
    P->>N4: COMMIT
    N2->>N2: commit when quorum=3
    N3->>N3: commit when quorum=3
    N4->>N4: commit when quorum=3
